OL,3,GNEWSAJury considers verdict in wife sex
OL,4,Aabuse trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has retired to consider its
OL,7,Fverdict in the case of four men on
OL,8,Ftrial for the abuse of a woman who was
OL,9,Fadvertised by her husband on the
OL,10,Finternet for sex.
OL,12,FNorman Macksoni, 48, Richard Wilkins,
OL,13,F62, Connor Sanderson-Doyle, 32, and
OL,14,FMohammed Hassan, 38, are on trial at
OL,15,FWinchester Crown Court after all four
OL,16,Fpleading not guilty to sexual offences
OL,17,Fagainst Joanne Young.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
