OL,3,GNEWSAJury considers verdict in wife sex
OL,4,Aabuse trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are charged jointly with her
OL,7,Fex-husband Philip Young, 50, a former
OL,8,FConservative councillor, who has
OL,9,Fadmitted drugging and raping his wife
OL,10,Fover 13 years.
OL,12,FYoung has pleaded guilty to a total of
OL,13,F56 charges including multiple counts of
OL,14,Frape, making and possessing indecent
OL,15,Fimages of children and possessing
OL,16,Fextreme pornography.
